"Although \"Ready-to-fly\" some additional parts are required to complete the"
" upgrade and fly with ArduPilot."
msgstr "虽然标注为「即飞」，但仍需一些额外配件才能完成升级并搭载 ArduPilot 飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:24
