"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/multistar-high-capacity-5200mah-4s-12c-multi-"
"rotor-lipo-pack-w-xt60.html?___store=en_us>`__"
msgstr ""
"LiPo 电池 `3S <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/multistar-high-capacity-3s-5200mah-"
"multi-rotor-lipo-pack.html?___store=en_us>`__ 或 `4S "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/multistar-high-capacity-5200mah-4s-12c-multi-"
"rotor-lipo-pack-w-xt60.html?___store=en_us>`__"

