#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:30
#: 3f162468e0474d6da6eaf3a08d0d80e8
msgid "Upgrading the vehicle's software"
msgstr "升级飞行器软件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:32
#: f8b2211e291b4c578f64139892661f43
msgid ""
"The Aero RTF may not have the last BIOS and Linux operating system. The "
"Linux distro on Aero needs to be updated to version 1.2 in order for the "
"autopilot to be flashed with ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"Aero RTF 的 BIOS 和 Linux 操作系统可能不是最新版本。Aero 上的 Linux 发行版需更新到 1.2 版本，飞控才能烧录 "
"ArduPilot 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:35
#: 10ade2d61ae049b2af21cd41522fce1e
msgid ""
"`Official Setup Instuctions from Intel <https://github.com/intel-aero/meta-"
"intel-aero/wiki/02-Initial-setup>`__ should be followed which will ask you "
"to:"
msgstr ""
"请按照 `Intel 官方安装说明 <https://github.com/intel-aero/meta-intel-"
"aero/wiki/02-Initial-setup>`__ 操作，具体步骤包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:37
#: 21b6ff08e1eb4510bff64aa7e9cc4212
msgid ""
"Download the latest OS image (aka \"intel-aero-image-intel-aero.iso\") and "
"Capsule/BIOS (aka \"capsule-01.00.12-r0.core2_64.rpm\") from the `Intel "
"Download Center <https://downloadcenter.intel.com/download/26500/UAV-"
"installation-files-for-Intel-Aero-Platform>`__"
msgstr ""
"从 `Intel 下载中心 <https://downloadcenter.intel.com/download/26500/UAV-"
"installation-files-for-Intel-Aero-Platform>`__ 下载最新 OS 镜像（即 「intel-aero-"
"image-intel-aero.iso」）和 Capsule/BIOS（即 「capsule-01.00.12-r0.core2_64.rpm」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:38
#: 255952600b2a4570a4a536e43c46f71d
msgid ""
"`Flash the BIOS to Aero compute board <https://github.com/intel-aero/meta-"
"intel-aero/wiki/02-Initial-setup#flashing-the-bios>`__"
msgstr ""
"`将 BIOS 烧录到 Aero 计算板 <https://github.com/intel-aero/meta-intel-"
"aero/wiki/02-Initial-setup#flashing-the-bios>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:39
#: a397e2a2748449619fa1762171cbcdfa
msgid ""
"`Flash the OS image to the Aero compute board <https://github.com/intel-"
"aero/meta-intel-aero/wiki/02-Initial-setup#flash-intel-aero-linux-"
"distribution>`__ using a USB thumb drive"
msgstr ""
"使用 USB U 盘 `将 OS 镜像烧录到 Aero 计算板 <https://github.com/intel-aero/meta-intel-"
"aero/wiki/02-Initial-setup#flash-intel-aero-linux-distribution>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:40
#: c6d7e0c01cb84ca7a4ecb2c9a2ecda7e
msgid ""
"`Upgrade the FPGA <https://github.com/intel-aero/meta-intel-"
"aero/wiki/02-Initial-setup#flashing-the-fpga>`__ using a .jam file included "
"on the OS image"
msgstr ""
"使用 OS 镜像中包含的 .jam 文件 `升级 FPGA <https://github.com/intel-aero/meta-intel-"
"aero/wiki/02-Initial-setup#flashing-the-fpga>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:42
#: 38243b8577f845ff819338deda01158e
msgid ""
"The final step is to copy the **arducopter.px4** firmware to the Aero "
"compute board and then flash it to the flight board:"
msgstr "最后一步是将 **arducopter.px4** 固件复制到 Aero 计算板，然后烧录到飞控板："

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:44
#: cfb0df93000a45da854ac10c223d6df4
msgid ""
"Download the latest aero-fc ArduPilot firmware from `firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/>`__"
msgstr ""
"从 `firmware.ardupilot.org <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/>`__"
" 下载最新的 aero-fc ArduPilot 固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:45
#: 4025221e8a134670a4cef5c22792a1c5
msgid ""
"Copy the above firmware to the Aero compute board in much the same way the "
"BIOS's .rpm file was copied"
msgstr "以与复制 BIOS .rpm 文件相同的方式，将上述固件复制到 Aero 计算板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:46
#: 0b084f061d9e4516bbc0018652cfcd3e
msgid ""
"`Flash the autopilot board <https://github.com/intel-aero/meta-intel-"
"aero/wiki/02-Initial-setup#flashing-the-flight-controller-rtf-only>`__ with "
"the **ardupilot.px4** firmware"
msgstr ""
"使用 **ardupilot.px4** 固件 `烧录飞控板 <https://github.com/intel-aero/meta-intel-"
"aero/wiki/02-Initial-setup#flashing-the-flight-controller-rtf-only>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:48
#: b810ac68547145f4b7499def99efd495
msgid ""
"If you are developing ArduPilot, you can flash directly from the command "
"line after compiling. Refer to `Build instructions "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__ for more "
"detailed instructions, but it's basically the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"如果您正在开发 ArduPilot，可在编译后直接从命令行烧录。详细说明请参考 `构建说明 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__，基本命令如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:50
#: 9db72fcf89b54901803055bd1a0452d9
msgid "./waf configure --board aerofc-v1 ./waf copter --upload"
msgstr "./waf configure --board aerofc-v1 ./waf copter --upload"

