"calibration>` （无需 :ref:`ESC 校准 <esc-calibration>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:68
#: 68d84baf91494d5b8f96dc0b82e66e5e
msgid "Connecting the Transmitter"
msgstr "连接遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:70
#: cc919615961d4a53af10799a2b520682
msgid ""
"The transmitter that comes with the RTF is an off the shelf DSM-X DXe and a "
"SPM4648 receiver, which is of autobind mode. The transmitter should always "
"be powered on before the receiver (which is normally powered together with "
"the vehicle).  If powered on after the vehicle it won't connect.  To "
"overcome this you can simply disconnect the cable from the receiver, or go "
"through the binding process, which involves powering on the transmitter "
"while holding the \"BIND/PANIC/TRAINER\" button pressed. More information "
"about the binding and connectiong can be found on the `receiver "
"documentation <https://www.horizonhobby.com/pdf/SPM4648-Manual-EN.pdf>`__."
msgstr ""
"RTF 配套的遥控器是现成的 DSM-X DXe，以及一个 SPM4648 "
"接收机，该接收机采用自动对频模式。遥控器应始终先于接收机（通常随飞行器一起上电）开机。若在飞行器之后开机将无法连接。解决方法是拔下接收机的连接线，或重新执行对频流程——在按住「BIND/PANIC/TRAINER」按钮的同时开启遥控器。更多对频和连接信息请参阅"
" `接收机文档 <https://www.horizonhobby.com/pdf/SPM4648-Manual-EN.pdf>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:73
#: 453c909e80644291a564d5476ea2f408
msgid "Known Issues with the Transmitter"
msgstr "遥控器的已知问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:75
#: 45c1105c57b64df2acda8c1da53def83
msgid ""
"the \"MOTOR/THROW\" switch on the back-right of the transmitter should "
"always be left in the \"ARM\" position or the throttle value sent to the "
"vehicle will be too low"
msgstr "遥控器右后方的「MOTOR/THROW」拨杆应始终保持在「ARM」位置，否则发送给飞行器的油门值将过低"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:76
#: 1483174a3ced401f9a03b69cbcdcc561
msgid ""
"the \"FLAP\" switch is connected to Ch7 so it can be used as an auxiliary "
"switch but position \"0\" is actually On, \"2\" is off."
msgstr "「FLAP」拨杆连接到 Ch7，可用作辅助开关，但位置「0」实为开，「2」为关"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:77
#: 1c838ed720ad4208bdfd981af6ba62c6
msgid "\"AUX\" and \"RATE\" switches are not configured to have any effect"
msgstr "「AUX」和「RATE」拨杆未配置任何功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:79
#: 02d1821e6e78489f9fa7ba07d795cdd3
msgid ""
"The last three issues mentioned above could be resolved by reprogramming the"
" transmitter using a `Spektrum TX/RX USB Programming Cable "
"<https://www.spektrumrc.com/Products/Default.aspx?ProdID=SPMA3065>`__"
msgstr ""
"上述最后三个问题可通过使用 `Spektrum TX/RX USB 编程线 "
"<https://www.spektrumrc.com/Products/Default.aspx?ProdID=SPMA3065>`__ "
"对遥控器重新编程来解决"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:82
#: 8adf6543db0d48c1bf762af41aeb9cba
msgid "Improving the vehicle's center of gravity"
msgstr "改善飞行器重心"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:87
#: 910cee3697e24ec8afe337b2b7cd90d2
msgid ""
"In the default configuration the vehicle is tail heavy but its center of "
"gravity can be improved by shifting the battery forward. Either attach the "
"battery to the underside of the vehicle (instead of between the upper and "
"lower platforms) or remove one of the blue pillars as shown above."
msgstr "默认配置下飞行器尾部偏重，但可通过将电池前移来改善重心。可将电池安装在飞行器底部（而非上下平台之间），或如上图所示拆除一根蓝色支柱。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:91
#: 791d67de04d84f5990ccf40ce926183b
msgid "More flight videos"
msgstr "更多飞行视频"
